      "description": "预览不接收交互，卡片打开详情，参考按钮独立。",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><a href=\"#command\"><div class=\"ds-stage\" inert><div class=\"ds-mini\">⌘ K　搜索或执行命令</div></div><h3>命令面板</h3><p>Command palette</p></a><button type=\"button\">＋ 加入参考</button></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{font-family:var(--font-sans,Geist,sans-serif);max-width:360px}.ds-card a{display:block;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg,#242428);border-radius:12px}.ds-stage{display:grid;place-items:center;height:190px;border:1px solid var(--line,#dddde3);border-radius:12px;background:#ededf2;pointer-events:none;transition:border-color 160ms var(--ease-out,cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1))}.ds-card a:hover .ds-stage{border-color:#aaaab8;background:#e8e8ef}.ds-mini{background:white;border-radius:8px;padding:14px;color:var(--gray-600,#575760);font-size:12px}.ds-card h3{margin:14px 0 0;font-size:14px;font-weight:550;line-height:1.5}.ds-card p{margin:5px 0 0;font:10px var(--font-mono,monospace);color:var(--gray-500,#666670)}.ds-card button{font-family:var(--font-sans,Geist,sans-serif);font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;display:block;margin-left:auto;height:32px;padding:0 6px;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--fg,#242428)}.ds-card button:hover{background:var(--fill,#e9e9ed)}.ds-card a:focus-visible,.ds-card button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue,#242428);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-card,.ds-mini,.ds-stage{transition-duration:.01ms!important;animation:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "命令标本",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "command-surface",
      "description": "首页展示可执行的导航命令，搜索入口打开全局搜索。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-command\"><button class=\"ds-command-search\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"/><path d=\"m16 16 5 5\"/></svg>你想做什么？<kbd>⌘ K</kbd></button><a href=\"#pages\">浏览页面参考 <span>→</span></a><a href=\"#styles\">探索视觉风格 <span>→</span></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-command{background:white;padding:6px;border-radius:13px;box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(41,58,34,.10);font-family:var(--font-sans,Geist,sans-serif)}.ds-command-search{font-family:var(--font-sans,Geist,sans-serif);font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:15px 12px 18px;margin-bottom:6px;width:100%;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#dddde3);background:transparent;color:var(--gray-500,#666670);text-align:left}.ds-command-search kbd{margin-left:auto;font-size:10px;border:1px solid var(--line,#dddde3);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px}.ds-command a{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:43px;padding:0 12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--gray-600,#575760);text-decoration:none}.ds-command a:first-of-type{background:#eeeef2;color:var(--fg,#242428)}.ds-command a span{margin-left:auto}.ds-command a:hover,.ds-command button:hover{background:#e7e7ed}.ds-command a:focus-visible,.ds-command button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--blue,#242428);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-command,.ds-command-search{transition-duration:.01ms!important;animation:none!important}}"
    },
